---
description: Repository rules for AI agents (mirrors AGENTS.md)
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root and the nested `AGENTS.md` in the folder you edit. They override any default behaviour.

Hard rules (summary):

- pnpm only; uv for Python. Never npm/yarn/pip.
- Never touch `.env*`, lockfiles, existing `**/migrations/*.sql`, `eslint.config.mjs`, `nx.json`, `.github/**`, `.husky/**`, `.claude/**`, `.cursor/**`, `tools/agents/**`, `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`.
- Never git push, reset --hard, clean -f, rebase, or use --no-verify.
- Never import across products, or connectors from products.
- Tenant routes: `app.authenticate` + `app.requireTenant(role)`; queries filter by `brand_id`/`organization_id`.
- Verify with `pnpm exec nx affected -t lint typecheck test build --base=main` before finishing.
- If a rule blocks the task, stop and ask.
